## Context
Audit finding A2 (`docs/2026-09-24-rules-coherence-audit.md`). `tickets/AGENTS.md:38` still says "on ID
collision, renumber to the next free ID", the race climate-finance-het
`rules/git.md` documents. The 2026-09-10 binary refresh (#1171) did not
upgrade the text: `erg init` was never re-run. Repo: MinhHaDuong/aedist-technical-report.

## Actions
Copy the harness `tickets/erg` (rev 63b5e92 or later) into the repo, then run
plain `tickets/erg init` (no `--force`: it refreshes `tickets/AGENTS.md` and
preserves a locally edited `.ergrc`). Verified on a scratch copy of aedist
2026-09-24: AGENTS.md becomes byte-identical to the harness copy, `erg check`
passes.

## Exit criteria
- [ ] `tickets/AGENTS.md` byte-identical to the harness copy
- [ ] `tickets/erg version` reports rev 63b5e92 or later
- [ ] `tickets/erg check tickets/` passes
- [ ] Merged in the target repo; PR number logged here
